<title>USA: AGCO receives approval to buy Xaver.</title>
<headline>AGCO receives approval to buy Xaver.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGCO Corp said on Friday that it received approval from the Federal Cartel Office in Germany to complete the purchase of all of the shares of Xaver Fendt GmbH &amp; Co, a maker and distributor of agricultural tractors in Germany.</p>
<p>The transaction will be completed on January 20.</p>
<p>AGCO expects to file a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the sale of 4.5 million shares of common stock to provide permanent financing for a portion of the purchase price and to provide ample debt capacity to take advantage of future growth opportunities.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
